        feeds enabled the feed absorbs most hits and the countries stay near zero.
        Spell the split out so the two numbers can be reconciled instead of
-       looking broken. Rendered only when the backend supplies it. */
-    var sp = document.getElementById('s_split');
-    if(sp){
+       looking broken. Rendered only when the backend supplies it.
